    "score": 35,
    "text": "Based on vermiceli&#x27;s annotated disassembly of Contra: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;vermiceli&#x2F;nes-contra-us\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;vermiceli&#x2F;nes-contra-us</a>. Thanks for the great work.<p>I ported it in two steps. First to C: the game logic is translated routine by routine from the 6502 assembly, and checked frame by frame against the original in the Mesen emulator. Then the C code to WebAssembly so it runs in the browser.<p>The cherry on top: online multiplayer, so two players can play co-op over the internet.<p>Source: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;epoyraz&#x2F;nes-contra-us\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;epoyraz&#x2F;nes-contra-us</a>",
    "time": 1793474328,
    "title": "Show HN: NES Contra (1987) port (ASM –> C and then C –> WebAssembly)",
    "type": "story",
    "url": "https://epoyraz.github.io/nes-contra-us/"
  },
